msgid ""
"All HPE Alletra MP Storage iSCSI ports are reachable from each of the "
"cluster hosts"
msgstr "Alle HPE Alletra MP Storage iSCSI-Ports sind von jedem der Cluster-Hosts aus erreichbar"

#: ../../integration_guides/storage/hpe-alletra-mp.rst:8
msgid ""
"The ``multipath.conf`` settings on each node should be configured as "
"follows:"
msgstr "Die ``multipath.conf``-Einstellungen auf jedem Knoten sollten wie folgt konfiguriert sein:"

